                        <strong>Tecnocomp Tecnologia e Serviços</strong><br>
                        <strong>Support Analyst (L1) - (Aug/2019 - Jan/2021)</strong><br>
                        <p>As a Support Analyst (L1), my role was to resolve, analyze, and forward tickets created by clients on service portals (ServiceNow and GLPI), in addition to providing support via email and VoIP. I also integrated systems for new clients and learned about the ITIL methodology.</p>
